{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2022-01-31 16:30:00', 'title': 'FSI AND BROADRIDGE RELEASE STUDY HIGHLIGHTING INDEPENDENT ADVISOR GROWTH OPPORTUNITIES', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JAN. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS , INC. (NYSE: BR), A GLOBAL FINTECH LEADER, AND THE FINANCIAL SERVICES INSTITUTE\xa0(FSI) TODAY RELEASED A JOINT STUDY OF OVER 400 U.S. FINANCIAL ADVISORS THAT SHEDS LIGHT ON GROWTH OPPORTUNITIES WITHIN THE WEALTH MANAGEMENT INDUSTRY. SPECIFICALLY, THE STUDY DEMONSTRATES THE OPPORTUNITY TO LEVERAGE DIGITAL TECHNOLOGY, EXPLORE NEW INVESTMENT VEHICLES, EXPAND BUSINESS, AND MAKE STRONGER CONNECTIONS WITH PREVIOUSLY UNDERSERVED COMMUNITIES AND THE NEXT GENERATION OF INVESTORS.'}